  "content_html": "<blockquote class=\"blyg-transclusion\" data-blyg-id=\"7k89sm5thgbfhzep7jfd58nm6m\" data-blyg-version=\"2\" data-blyg-origin=\"https://venkateshrao.com/blyg/\">\n<p>Please don’t name your blyg just <em>blyg.</em> Call it something like <em>John Doe’s blyg</em> if you can’t think of a creative name. Otherwise the reading feed is very confusing. Please stub this far and wide to propagate this norm. I’ll make the reference client pick better personalized default names but I can’t control what other clients do.</p>\n\n</blockquote>\n",
